 54→  // W43 M1: the rider's structured absence question. The pack's own field name — the
 55→  // one the NS-6 gate reads on the record — asked only on the rider no-show filing,
 56→  // as a real Yes/No control, and sent only when the party chose an answer. It is
 57→  // deliberately not one of the questionnaire rows: the pinned three-row rider
 58→  // no-show list stays exactly as it is, and no id is added to the shells.
 59→  var ABSENCE_KEY = "rider_claims_driver_absent";
 60→  var ABSENCE_QUESTION = {
 61→    key: ABSENCE_KEY,
 62→    label: "Did the driver fail to show up at the pickup point?",
 63→    kind: "yes_no"
 64→  };
