 91→  // W20: what the current question list was built for. Trip Continue rebuilds the
 92→  // questions only when the category or the trip changed, so Back/Continue keeps
 93→  // every answer; a different trip or a category switch clears the draft.
 94→  var questionsKey = null;
 95→
 96→  // W20: the trip the party last picked, remembered independently of the load
 97→  // attempt so a failed or superseded reload does not lose it. The next successful
 98→  // list that still carries it restores the selection; a list that no longer does
 99→  // leaves the step unselected. A category switch clears it.
100→  var rememberedTripId = null;
